State shooting complex-funding amendment.
Sponsored by: Senator(s) Rothfuss
A BILL
for
1 AN ACT relating to the Wyoming state shooting complex;
2 amending conditions on previously appropriated funds; and
3 providing for an effective date.
4
5 Be It Enacted by the Legislature of the State of Wyoming:
6
7 Section 1. 2023 Wyoming Session Laws, Chapter 146,
8 Section 3(b) is amended to read:
9
10 (b) The amounts appropriated under subsection (a) of
11 this section to the state shooting complex account shall
12 only be expended through additional action of the
13 legislature by the department of state parks and cultural
14 resources for the siting and construction of the Wyoming
15 state shooting complex. This appropriation shall not be
16 transferred or expended for any other purpose. Any
